<title>USA: Municipal says earnings near expectations.</title>
<headline>Municipal says earnings near expectations.</headline>
<dateline>BALTIMORE 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Municipal Mortgage and Equity LLC on Wednesday said its earnings are in line with expectations.</p>
<p>&quot;Our earnings...are in line with published expectations,&quot; said Mark Joseph, chairman and chief executive.</p>
<p>MuniMae said it had previously announced first quarter results including net income of $4.53 million, up 40 percent over the same period last year.</p>
